o Ayakari-san! I'm excited to finally ask for a commission!\n\nI would like to ask for an llustration of my Captain Tsubasa Original Character カザオ who is Hugging plushies of Masao and Kazuo Tachibana.\n\nI will use the illustration as wallpaper and profile picture.\n\nOriginal character Reference: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x7O5WHMl3rptCHfl3YYbvgwuTxuGnjCk\n\nMasao and Kazuos outfits: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Gbtn-pbMeuEsRZUWM_vSCmYhGtK5Ihje\n\nこんにちは、あやかりさん！ついにコミッションをお願いできて、とても楽しみです！\n\n私の『キャプテン翼』のオリジナルキャラクター「カザオ」が、立花政夫と和夫のぬいぐるみを抱きしめているイラストをお願いしたいです。\n\nこのイラストは、壁紙やプロフィール画像として使用したいと考えています。\n\nオリジナルキャラクターの参考画像: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1x7O5WHMl3rptCHfl3YYbvgwuTxuGnjCk\n\n政夫と和夫の衣装: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Gbtn-pbMeuEsRZUWM_vSCmYhGtK5Ihje", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@Ayakari399/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2981934, "client_id": 1062675, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bfc8beef/uploads/origins/7918cd76-1a19-4672-9d18-14774bba9e26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d31901286f1a070467f376005c4e1f5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bfc8beef/uploads/origins/7918cd76-1a19-4672-9d18-14774bba9e26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d31901286f1a070467f376005c4e1f5, https://si.imgix.net/bfc8beef/uploads/origins/7918cd76-1a19-4672-9d18-14774bba9e26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbaac239e157dfda0ae82a11699511c0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bfc8beef/uploads/origins/7918cd76-1a19-4672-9d18-14774bba9e26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b394b27d672aa82c74f4e7242f317263 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "